        <body>
            <div xml:id="d490">

                <pb facs="0844" n="750" sameAs="frus:frus1887/pg750"/>

                <head>No. 490.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Connery to Mr. Bayard.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Legation of the United States</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1887-10-20"><hi rendition="#italic">October</hi> 20, 1887</date>.
                        (Received October 29.)</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 253.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to refer you to my No.
                    250, concerning the relations of Guatemala and Mexico, dated October 18, 1887,
                    and to report that I have just received another note from Mr. Mariscal, copy of
                    which I inclose, in which he expresses his high appreciation of your faith in
                    the frankness and sincerity of Mexico’s expressions respecting the neighboring
                    republic of Guatemala.</p>
                <p>I am, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Thomas B.
                    Connery.</hi></signed></closer>



                <xi:include href="d490-a1.xml" xpointer="d490-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
